<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="git-addon-switching-between-local-branches">
  <title>Switch Between Local Branches</title>
  
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>switching branches</indexterm></indexterm>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>local branches</indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <body>
    <p id="p_knw_kly_kpb">To switch between local branches from the <xref
        href="git-addon-git-staging-view-interface.dita#git-addon-git-staging-view-interface"
          ><uicontrol>Git Staging</uicontrol> view</xref>, use the <uicontrol>Branch</uicontrol>
      dropdown list. You can also switch local branches from the <xref
        href="git-addon-git-branch-manager.dita#git-addon-git-branch-manager" format="dita"
          ><uicontrol>Git Branch Manager</uicontrol></xref>.</p>
    <p>
      <fig id="fig_cqn_kdk_mjc">
        <title>Choosing a branch in the <uicontrol>Branch</uicontrol> dropdown list</title>
        <image href="../img/git-addon/staging/staging_choose_branch_menu.png" id="image_px2_5jt_njc"
        />
      </fig>
    </p>
    <p id="p_lnw_kly_kpb">You can create new branches from the <xref
        href="git-addon-git-branch-manager.dita#git-addon-git-branch-manager" format="dita"
          ><uicontrol>Git Branch Manager</uicontrol></xref> or from the <xref
        href="git-addon-showing-the-repository-history.dita#git-addon-showing-the-repository-history/section_git_history_table"
          ><uicontrol>History</uicontrol> table</xref> using <xref
        href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_create_branch"
          ><uicontrol>Create branch</uicontrol></xref> in the context menu. </p>
    <p>Switch to a branch after checking it out from the <uicontrol>Git History</uicontrol> view by
      double-clicking a commit row in the <xref
        href="git-addon-showing-the-repository-history.dita#git-addon-showing-the-repository-history/section_git_history_table"
          ><uicontrol>History</uicontrol> table</xref> or from the checkout dialog.  For more
      information, see <xref href="git-addon-check-out-a-branch.dita#git-addon-check-out-a-branch"
          ><uicontrol>Check Out a Branch</uicontrol></xref>.</p>
  </body>
</topic>
